    # mc "Good morning..."
    mc "早上好……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:9
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_58ae9bbf:

    # js "I get it... You need coffee! We're on our way to get some. You should tag along."
    js "我懂了…你肯定需要咖啡！我们正要去买，你最好也一起来。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:11
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_253ce317:

    # mc "No, I'm good."
    mc "不，我没事。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:13
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_08689d8d:

    # js "How was your weekend?"
    js "你这周末过得怎么样？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:15
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_1a802663:

    # mc "It was...ok. Wait, it wasn't ok. It was pretty bad."
    mc "就是...还行。啊，不对，其实挺糟糕的。真的很差。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:16
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_4929986d:

    # mc "The DIKs had a huge fight yesterday."
    mc "昨天 DIKs 内部大吵了一架。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:18
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_08198b05:

    # my "Oh? What happened?"
    my "哦？怎么了？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:20
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_37aba127:

    # mc "I don't feel like talking about it. Maybe later."
    mc "我现在不想说，晚点再聊吧。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:22
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_7a475c54:

    # js "That sucks. But at least you got to see your dad, right?"
    js "真糟心。不过至少见到你爸爸了，对吧？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:24
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_2a3e8c7c:

    # mc "Yeah...about that. It wasn't the best either."
    mc "嗯……关于那个。那件事也不太好。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:25
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_f4d11690:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:27
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_96118817:

    # mc "I told him about you girls and us. But I felt like he didn't understand what we were doing together."
    mc "我把你们俩，还有我们的关系告诉了他。可我觉得，他不理解我们三个人为什么会在一起。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:28
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_7fcfc20f:

    # mc "He said it doesn't sound like a relationship and that I will end up hurting you because there are two of you."
    mc "他说听起来不像一段关系，还说我会伤害你们，因为有两个人。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:30
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_4f9c6a01:

    # my "Did you explain it well enough for him to understand?"
    my "你跟他说清楚了吗？让他明白了吗？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:32
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_0fd58d85:

    # mc "I tried to, but Dad was skeptical about it."
    mc "我试着解释了，但我爸对这事还是持怀疑态度。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:33
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_1a197b2f:

    # mc "He said that women do not always tell guys how they feel or that they lie or pretend about it."
    mc "他说女人不总是会告诉男生她们的真实感受，或者她们会撒谎、假装。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:34
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_dcd11a7b:

    # mc "He questioned whether our feelings were mutual or not."
    mc "他质疑我们的感情是不是互相的。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:36
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_a6017685:

    # mc "Before telling him about us, I would never have guessed he'd react that way."
    mc "在告诉他我们之前，我根本想不到他会这样反应。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:37
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_53e63a49:

    # mc "I thought he would be happy and supportive, but he was confused and worried about me hurting you two."
    mc "我以为他会高兴，会支持我们。可他却很困惑，担心我会伤害你们俩。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:38
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_e60033c2:

    # mc "It bummed me out."
    mc "这让我挺郁闷的。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:40
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_1a2487c0:

    # my "Well... I know how that feels."
    my "嗯……我明白那种感觉。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:41
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_b32a40b3:

    # my "I want to say I am surprised, too, but I'm not."
    my "我也想说我很惊讶，但我不是。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:43
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_3c5fcdee:

    # my "At times, we don't even understand what this is ourselves. How can we expect our parents to understand?"
    my "有时候，我们自己都搞不清楚这到底是什么。我们怎么指望父母能理解呢？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:45
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_27c7f75c:

    # mc "Yeah, but I was excited about telling him about us. I wanted to bring you two back home with me and meet him."
    mc "是啊，可我原本很期待把我们的事告诉他，还想带你们俩回家见他。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:46
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_be664f7a:

    # mc "Now I feel like I can't do that at all. It feels like it's ruined."
    mc "现在我完全没办法这么做。感觉一切都毁了。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:51
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_9dcd3bc6:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:53
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_492880c3:

    # js "I couldn't bring both of you back home either."
    js "我也带不回你们两个一起回家。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:54
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_720da326:

    # js "Not without having to lie about us."
    js "除非隐瞒我们的关系。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:55
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_be4f1f31:

    # js "I get why you feel it's ruined."
    js "我明白你为什么觉得一切都毁了。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:57
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_5edc1559:

    # mc "Yeah... Is this what it will have to be for us?"
    mc "是啊……难道我们以后就只能这样了吗？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:58
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_4429feb3:

    # mc "Will our parents never understand us?"
    mc "我们的父母永远都不会理解我们吗？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:60
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_220cad63:

    # my "Maybe your dad will come around? It was a big shock to him."
    my "也许你爸能想通？那天对他来说是个很大的冲击。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:62
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_227f4d98:

    # mc "Sorry for bumming you out with this. I'm feeling low today..."
    mc "抱歉让你心情变差了，今天我感觉挺低落的……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:64
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_17488e41:

    # js "Can we do something?"
    js "我们能做点什么吗？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:66
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_3199e7ea:

    # mc "No, thanks. There's nothing you can do. I need some time and space to sulk for a while."
    mc "不用了，谢谢。这事你们也没办法。我想自己待一会儿，闷一阵子。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:68
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_d402e4f4:

    # my "Poor [name]..."
    my "可怜的[name]..."

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:70
translate schinese ep11_jmc_label_630d751c:

    # js "I know. He speaks so fondly about his dad all the time. This must have hurt him a lot."
    js "是啊，他每次说起爸爸都特别亲近。这次肯定很伤心。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:89
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_ae7b6667:

    # js "So? What do you think?"
    js "所以？你怎么想？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:91
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_8632fd09:

    # mc "So this is what you've been up to?"
    mc "这就是你最近在忙的事？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:93
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_1ad184de:

    # js "Mhm..."
    js "嗯……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:95
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b9e8a39d:

    # mc "I'm relieved."
    mc "我松了口气。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:97
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_7cd432f5:

    # js "What do you mean?"
    js "你是什么意思？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:99
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b6eaceed:

    # mc "I thought you were distancing yourself for some other reason, maybe because you didn't feel good. Like I haven't been feeling like myself either."
    mc "我以为你最近疏远我，是有别的原因，也许是心情不好。毕竟我最近也一直不太在状态。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:101
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b02da835:

    # js "Honestly, you're not far off with that assumption."
    js "说实话，你这个猜测差不太多。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:102
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_39a807be:

    # js "That's pretty much how all of this started."
    js "这基本上就是一切的开始。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:104
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_e3a483b6:

    # js "I felt down one day and started searching for ways to feel better about myself and things to do."
    js "我那天情绪低落，就开始找些让自己感觉好点的方法，还有点事情做。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:105
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_fbc69943:

    # js "I want to be different...but I feel lost."
    js "我想变得不一样……但我感觉迷失了。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:107
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_5842c91a:

    # mc "Different how?"
    mc "不同在哪方面？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:109
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_6497fe11:

    # js "I'm not sure, but I think this will help me figure it out."
    js "我不确定，但我觉得这能帮我弄清楚点什么。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:111
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_67567493:

    # mc "Then I think it's great that you're doing something for yourself."
    mc "然后我觉得你为自己做点什么真的很棒。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:112
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_3b34e33c:

    # mc "It's good to have hobbies."
    mc "有爱好是好事。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:114
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_88e6bf7a:

    # js "It's more than a hobby to me. I want this to be me."
    js "对我来说，这不只是爱好。我想让它成为我的一部分。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:115
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_2f402426:

    # js "Something that makes me stand out. You know, not something basic?"
    js "让我显得与众不同。你懂吧，不是什么普通的东西？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:119
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_28ba26d1:

    # mc "This isn't about what that guy said to you, right?"
    mc "这不会是因为那个男的对你说的话吧？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:121
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_ea229aa5:

    # js "What guy?"
    js "什么人？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:123
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_c6cd2d70:

    # mc "That guy from the Halloween party."
    mc "那个万圣节派对上的家伙。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:125
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_556cca34:

    # js "No, he's got nothing to do with this."
    js "不，他跟这事没关系。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:127
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_964629d4:

    # mc "Are you sure? Because I remember you telling me that he called you that - \"basic\". And I've never heard you refer to yourself as such."
    mc "你确定？我记得你说过，他说你“没个性”。以前我可从没听你这么形容自己。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:129
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_d3286bb2:

    # js "Whatever. It's not about him. I mean..."
    js "随便啦。这事儿和他没关系。我意思是……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:130
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_4f5302c8:

    # js "Maybe he set off this whirlpool of emotions I'm feeling, but it's not all about what he said."
    js "也许是他引发了我现在的这些情绪漩涡，但这一切并不全是因为他说了什么。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:132
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_642a55f7:

    # js "Many other things in my life are causing me to ask questions."
    js "我生活中还有许多其他事情让我开始质疑自己。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:133
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b74a31e3:

    # js "All this is about what I've realized about myself and what I'm trying to say with this blog."
    js "这一切都是关于我对自己的一些认识，以及我想通过这个博客表达的东西。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:135
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_279c9b86:

    # mc "Well, I think the blog is a great idea if you're doing it for the right reasons."
    mc "那好吧，如果你是出于正确的原因在做这个博客，我觉得这个想法挺不错的。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:136
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_7d74a976:

    # mc "Because if this is about proving a point to someone that doesn't matter, then you're giving them a whole lot of power over you."
    mc "因为如果这全是为了向一个根本不重要的人证明什么，那你就是在把大把的权力交到他们手上。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:138
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_e8627abb:

    # js "It is for the right reasons."
    js "这是出于正确的理由。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:139
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_895cdf44:

    # js "I feel like all this creativity is bubbling inside me, and I have found an outlet for it."
    js "我觉得自己体内有很多创意在涌动，我找到了一个释放它们的出口。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:141
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_3aa5178e:

    # mc "Ok, I hear you. I wanted to make sure because I care about you."
    mc "好的，我听你说的。我之所以这么问，是因为我关心你。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:142
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_0717bf68:

    # mc "You bought a lot of clothes, huh?"
    mc "你买了不少衣服啊？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:144
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_8fab702f:

    # js "I dipped into my savings, but it's ok."
    js "动用了一点积蓄，不过没关系。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:146
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b481730b:

    # mc "What do you do with the clothes after you've taken pictures of them?"
    mc "你拍完照片之后打算怎么处理这些衣服？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:148
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_b19a2c84:

    # js "I haven't given it much thought yet. At the moment, I guess I'm stockpiling everything..."
    js "我还没怎么认真想过这事。现在嘛，我想我大概是在囤积一切……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:149
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_6c4c143e:

    # js "I'll use some of it again, but far from all of it."
    js "我会再用掉一些，但远不是全部。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:151
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_89708130:

    # js "I could sell the clothes, but that would make Heather right about what I'm doing here..."
    js "也可以把衣服卖掉，可那样就让Heather说中了，说我在这儿做的那些事……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:153
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_ba19cb53:

    # mc "Well... You should sell some of it. I mean... Yikes."
    mc "那……你该卖点出去。我是说……天啊。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:155
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_86f9f4e7:

    # js "What?"
    js "什么？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:157
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_9e3f4189:

    # mc "What do you mean by \"what\"? Look at this thing. Why would you buy this?"
    mc "什么叫“什么”？看看这个，你怎么会买这种东西？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:159
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_bcfe2dfb:

    # js "It's cute, and it made me happy."
    js "它挺可爱的，还让我挺开心的。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:161
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_231a85fc:

    # mc "Yeah, but you wouldn't use this one."
    mc "可是，这个你根本不会用吧。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:163
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_c5d631d6:

    # js "I so would."
    js "我当然会用。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:165
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_beb994a0:

    # mc "I'll say it... It's horrible. I hate it."
    mc "我直说了……丑死了。我讨厌这个包。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:167
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_87bd802b:

    # js "Stop it! That duck is cute, haha!"
    js "别闹了！那只鸭子挺可爱的，哈哈！"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:169
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_24a41e48:

    # mc "It's a kid's bag."
    mc "这是个小孩用的包。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:171
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_85955100:

    # js "No, it's not. You don't understand fashion."
    js "不，不是这样的。你根本不懂时尚。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:173
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_2b82e4ae:

    # js "Quack quack!"
    js "嘎嘎！"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:175
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_2975375b:

    # mc "Haha, get it away from me."
    mc "哈哈，快把它拿远点。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:177
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_83286f0e:

    # mc "Who's helping you take all those pictures for your blog?"
    mc "谁帮你拍那么多照片发博客的？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:179
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_ed5a1265:

    # js "No one. I've used a tripod for it. But I admit it's limiting what I can shoot. I wish I had someone to take pictures of me."
    js "没人。我用三脚架拍的。不过我承认这样限制了我能拍的东西。我希望有人能给我拍照。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:181
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_71448f62:

    # mc "What about Maya?"
    mc "让Maya帮忙呢？"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:183
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_ee6c5265:

    # js "I...uh...haven't included her in this yet. And until today, I hadn't included you either, so..."
    js "我……呃……还没让她参与进来。直到今天才让你知道，所以……"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:185
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_66a4e3a3:

    # mc "She'd probably enjoy it. I bet she also knows what makes a good photo, given how many movies she's watched."
    mc "她大概会喜欢的。我打赌她也懂怎么拍出好照片，毕竟她看了那么多电影。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:187
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_aa22dfa0:

    # js "What about you? You helped out with the camera during Halloween."
    js "那你怎么看？你上次万圣节也帮忙照过相。"

# episode11\branches\ep11_jm_branch.rpy:189
translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_f0a8a6c3:

