translate schinese ep11_jsolo_label_a51f2eb9:

    # ir "I'd love to hear all about this over Christmas. Listen, I have to go; I have a client meeting."
    ir "圣诞的时候我很想听听你讲讲这些。对了，我得走了，有个客户会议。"

